1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,691
This clip was cropped, recolored, captioned, and played faster.

2
00:00:03,691 --> 00:00:11,073
Where did it come from? Traceback reconnects edited video with an indexed source, and makes the evidence visible.

3
00:00:11,073 --> 00:00:13,944
This walkthrough uses actual recorded pipeline outputs.

4
00:00:15,144 --> 00:00:21,344
The frontier technology is Qwen three V L Embedding, released in January twenty twenty six.

5
00:00:21,344 --> 00:00:26,305
It searches actual frame pixels and natural language in the same space.

6
00:00:26,305 --> 00:00:31,265
Describe a scene, inspect the retrieved moment, or submit an edited clip.

7
00:00:31,265 --> 00:00:34,985
The local application accepts new sources and new queries.

8
00:00:36,185 --> 00:00:38,807
Similarity alone is not a verdict.

9
00:00:38,807 --> 00:00:43,614
Traceback checks unique visual correspondences, consistent geometry, and aligned image appearance.

10
00:00:43,614 --> 00:00:50,606
These green points are measured matches, not an illustration of what the model might have seen.

11
00:00:50,606 --> 00:00:55,413
Multiple frames then support a source interval and a playback estimate.

12
00:00:55,413 --> 00:00:58,035
Weak or ambiguous timing stays explicit.

13
00:00:59,235 --> 00:01:02,108
A montage can contain more than one source.

14
00:01:02,108 --> 00:01:07,496
Here, the first part comes from the bridge excerpt, and the second from the laboratory.

15
00:01:07,496 --> 00:01:11,088
Each source has its own matching frames and query interval.

16
00:01:11,088 --> 00:01:13,243
Selecting a source opens its evidence.

17
00:01:13,243 --> 00:01:16,116
Unmatched gaps are not proof of original content.

18
00:01:17,316 --> 00:01:21,786
This unrelated clip has no verified source in the indexed library.

19
00:01:21,786 --> 00:01:24,224
Traceback does not force a match.

20
00:01:24,224 --> 00:01:31,538
The evaluation page publishes every controlled test case, including failures, and states the small scope of the experiment.

21
00:01:31,538 --> 00:01:34,789
It is not an internet scale accuracy claim.

22
00:01:35,989 --> 00:01:45,454
Export the inspected frames, measured correspondences, media hashes, pinned model revision, and engine fingerprint in one evidence packet.

23
00:01:45,454 --> 00:01:48,609
An independent verifier checks its checksums.

24
00:01:48,609 --> 00:01:52,290
Those checksums protect file integrity, not authorship.

25
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:57,549
Shared imagery does not establish ownership, infringement, or first publication.

26
00:01:58,749 --> 00:02:02,923
Traceback runs locally on a laptop CPU and is open source.

27
00:02:02,923 --> 00:02:06,717
The hosted demo lets you inspect real saved results immediately.

28
00:02:06,717 --> 00:02:09,373
Start the local service for new inference.

29
00:02:09,373 --> 00:02:14,306
Find the source behind the edit, and see exactly what supports the connection.
